      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each root-to-leaf path is one subset; all four combinations are shown.\nBacktracking explores one path at a time. When a branch cannot lead to a solution,\nit undoes the last choice and returns to a sibling instead of continuing down that branch.",
